e identified as \"Sanjō, the second\" or as \"Sanjō II.\"\nIt was during, and due to, Go-Sanjo's reign that the Fujiwara grip on power was broken; following Go-Sanjo's rule, their power continued to wane until 1150, when any semblance of their power disappeared.","wp_description":"Emperor of Japan from 1068 to 1073","wikipedia_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emperor_Go-Sanj%C5%8D","image_lead":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/Emperor_Go-sanj%C5%8D.jpg","thumbnail":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/Emperor_Go-sanj%C5%8D.jpg","chat_ready":true,"display_from":1068,"display_to":1073}